{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "AI Horse Racing Predictions API",
    "description": "\n## AI Horse Racing Predictions API v1.0\n\nThe most advanced **self-learning** horse racing prediction API available.\nPowered by **DeepSeek AI** with daily automated data scraping and a\nnightly self-improvement learning loop.\n\nDomain: **horse.aibettips.io**\n\n---\n\n### 17 Betting Markets\n\nEvery horse in every race receives AI-generated probabilities for **all 17 markets**:\n\n| # | Market | Description |\n|---|--------|-------------|\n| 1 | **Win** | Win probability + fair odds |\n| 2 | **Place** | Top 2/3/4 finish probability (correct terms) |\n| 3 | **Each Way Value** | AI edge vs market each way price |\n| 4 | **Top 4 Finish** | Board finish probability |\n| 5 | **Head to Head** | Probability vs nearest rival |\n| 6 | **Forecast** | 1st + 2nd in correct order |\n| 7 | **Reverse Forecast** | 1st + 2nd either order |\n| 8 | **Exacta** | Exact 1-2 combination |\n| 9 | **Trifecta** | Exact 1-2-3 combination |\n| 10 | **Going Suitability** | How well current going suits horse |\n| 11 | **Distance Suitability** | Optimal distance match score |\n| 12 | **Course Specialist** | Course win rate analysis |\n| 13 | **Jockey Form** | Jockey current hot/cold streak |\n| 14 | **Trainer Form** | Trainer recent strike rate |\n| 15 | **Draw Bias** | Stall/post position advantage |\n| 16 | **Class Assessment** | Class drop/rise confidence |\n| 17 | **Value Bet** | AI probability vs market implied odds |\n\n---\n\n### Rich Analysis Per Horse\n\n- **Form Analysis** — last 6 runs in detail, trend, consistency\n- **Pace Analysis** — race shape, pace scenario, who benefits\n- **Race Analysis** — full field assessment\n- **Betting Strategies** — per-market recommendations\n- **Value Bets** — where AI probability exceeds market odds\n- **Pre-Race Alerts** — course debutant, trainer switch, weight rise/drop\n\n---\n\n### Racecourses Covered\n\n**Primary:** Cheltenham · Ascot · Newmarket · Epsom · York · Sandown ·\nLeopardstown · Curragh · Punchestown · ParisLongchamp · Churchill Downs · Flemington\n\n**Extended:** 30+ additional GB/IRE/FR/USA/AUS tracks\n\n---\n\n### Self-Learning AI\n\nNightly learning loop:\n1. Evaluates all predictions against actual finishing positions\n2. Computes rolling win/place accuracy and simulated ROI\n3. Asks DeepSeek AI to self-identify biases (going, distance, class)\n4. Injects improvement notes into next day's predictions\n\n---\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/predictions/race/{race_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Predictions"
        ],
        "summary": "Get AI predictions for all runners in a race",
        "description": "On-demand prediction flow:\n- Cached → return immediately (200)\n- Not cached → trigger async Lambda, return 202 (retry in 20-30s)\n- force_regenerate=true → wipe cache and re-generate",
        "operationId": "get_race_predictions_predictions_race__race_id__get",
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "race_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "Race ID",
              "title": "Race Id"
            },
            "description": "Race ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "force_regenerate",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Force new AI generation even if cached",
              "default": false,
              "title": "Force Regenerate"
            },
            "description": "Force new AI generation even if cached"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
